{"w":["2026-11-23","2026-11-29"],"built":"2026-11-23T21:04Z","pending":70,"N":["","Bundaberg's FAQ lists Ginger Beer among the beverages \"suitable for vegans\".","Bundaberg's FAQ lists Diet Ginger Beer among the beverages \"suitable for vegans\".","Bundaberg's FAQ lists Sarsaparilla among the beverages \"suitable for vegans\".","Patak's AU product page says \"Suitable for vegetarians and vegans\", but Patak's AU FAQ says it makes no vegan claims.","Kellogg's NZ product page states \"Suitable for vegans.\"","Pepsi Max official FAQ: \"Yes, Pepsi MAX is suitable for both vegetarians and vegans.\"","Forty Thieves FAQ: \"all of our nut butter products are 100% plant-based / vegan and dairy-free.\"","Remedy: \"Kombucha, Sodaly and Switchel are all vegan-friendly.\"","Woolworths NZ pack claim: \"Vegan; USDA Organic\"; the coconut milk is plant milk.","Bluebird's NZ FAQ (maker of Copper Kettle) lists Copper Kettle Sea Salt as suitable for vegans.","Vitasoy's Protein Plus product page states \"suitable for vegetarians and vegans\".","Vitasoy's Almond Milky product page states \"Suitable for vegetarians and vegans.\"","Chelsea FAQ: nearly all its sugars and syrups suit vegans; the only exception is Honey Maple Flavoured Syrup.","PETA Australia's accidentally vegan list includes Arnott's Farmbake Peanut Brownie biscuits.","Woolworths NZ pack claim says vegan, but emulsifier 471 (source unstated) is listed; check first.","PAK'nSAVE describes these peeled edamame as a protein option for vegetarians, vegans and pescatarians; maker lists soybeans and salt only.","PETA Australia lists Pringles Original as accidentally vegan, but Pringles makes no vegan claim and its Original Minis list emulsifier 471; check first.","PETA Australia's Accidentally Vegan list includes Pringles BBQ.","Lo Bros FAQ: \"Yes! We are 100% vegan.\" NZ Ginger & Turmeric 330ml ingredients list no animal products.","Lo Bros FAQ: \"Yes! We are 100% vegan.\" NZ Feijoa 330ml ingredients list no animal products.","PETA Australia's accidentally vegan list includes Sour Patch Kids.","PETA Australia's Accidentally Vegan list includes Sour Patch Kids under Lollies and Chocolate, with no flavour caveat.","PETA Australia's accidentally vegan list includes Arnott's Gingernut biscuits.","Clean Collective's product page says \"They're also vegan, gluten-free, and keto-friendly.\"","Bluebird's NZ FAQ lists Bluebird Ready Salted (Originals, Thick Cut and Thinly Cut) as suitable for vegans.","New World describes it as a \"good source of iodine, vegan, no MSG or preservatives.\"","Ceres Organics' product page lists Vegan among its dietary attributes, with a Vegan badge.","PETA Australia lists Oreo Classic as accidentally vegan, but Oreo's own FAQ calls it lacto-vegetarian (may contain milk), not vegan.","PETA Australia lists Oreo Chocolate as accidentally vegan, but Oreo's own FAQ calls it lacto-vegetarian (may contain milk), not vegan."],"S":["Woolworths label","Bundaberg (manufacturer)","Patak's (manufacturer)","Kellogg's (manufacturer)","Pepsi Max (manufacturer)","Forty Thieves (manufacturer)","Remedy (manufacturer)","Woolworths NZ listing (pack claim)","Bluebird (manufacturer)","Vitasoy (manufacturer)","Chelsea (manufacturer)","PETA Australia","PAK'nSAVE","Lo Bros (manufacturer)","Clean Collective (manufacturer)","New World","Ceres Organics (manufacturer)"],"U":["","https://www.bundaberg.com/en-us/faqs/","https://www.pataks.com.au/product/pataks-eggplant-pickle-312g/","https://www.pataks.com.au/product/pataks-lime-pickle-283g/","https://www.kelloggs.co.nz/en_NZ/products/sultana-bran-product.html","https://www.pepsimax.com.au/faq","https://www.fortythieves.co.nz/faqs/","https://www.remedydrinks.com/blogs/news/are-remedy-drinks-vegan","https://www.bluebird.co.nz/faqs","https://soy.com.au/product/soy-milk-protein-plus/","https://soy.com.au/product/almond-milky/","https://www.chelsea.co.nz/about-sugar/faqs/","https://www.peta.org.au/living/accidentally-vegan/","https://www.paknsave.co.nz/